# Code owners for this repository.
#
# One line, because there is one maintainer. `MAINTAINERS.md` is the roster and
# says what that means for anyone depending on this software; this file is only
# the mechanism GitHub uses to request a review.
#
# At the repository root rather than `.github/`, deliberately: GitHub accepts
# either location, and the four sibling repositories (`hl7-rust`, `er7-rust`,
# `fhir-rust`, `snomed-rust`) all keep it at the root — professionalization
# rule 8 says conventions sync through the family rather than drifting
# independently, and this file moved on 2026-08-26 to match.
#
# The owner is written as an email address rather than a handle because that is
# how the maintainer is identified everywhere else here — `CITATION.cff`,
# `MAINTAINERS.md`, the commit history. GitHub resolves an email in this file
# only when it is a verified address on an account with write access; if a
# review request ever fails to appear, that resolution is the thing to check,
# and `@joelparkerhenderson` is the equivalent handle.

*       joel@joelparkerhenderson.com
